{"id":11097,"date":"2022-12-05T12:52:42","date_gmt":"2022-12-05T12:52:42","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/?p=11097"},"modified":"2022-12-05T12:52:42","modified_gmt":"2022-12-05T12:52:42","slug":"neni-snih-jako-snih-kvantitativni-analyza-kokainu-pomoci-ft-ramanovy-spektroskopie","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/neni-snih-jako-snih-kvantitativni-analyza-kokainu-pomoci-ft-ramanovy-spektroskopie\/","title":{"rendered":"Nen\u00ed sn\u00edh jako sn\u00edh: Kvantitativn\u00ed anal\u00fdza kokainu pomoc\u00ed FT-Ramanovy spektroskopie"},"content":{"rendered":"<p>Ve v\u0161ech d\u016fle\u017eit\u00fdch p\u0159\u00edstavech severn\u00ed Evropy v\u00fdrazn\u011b nar\u016fst\u00e1 mno\u017estv\u00ed zadr\u017een\u00fdch neleg\u00e1ln\u00edch drog. Rotterdam, Anvers, Dunkerque a Le Havre jsou pova\u017eov\u00e1ny za hlavn\u00ed br\u00e1ny pa\u0161er\u00e1k\u016f do Evropy. A zat\u00edmco drogov\u00ed magn\u00e1ti se raduj\u00ed z\u00a0p\u0159edstavy b\u00edl\u00fdch V\u00e1noc, bezpe\u010dnostn\u00ed slo\u017eky a jejich laborato\u0159e jsou postaveny p\u0159ed \u00fakol rychl\u00e9 a spolehliv\u00e9 identifikace podez\u0159el\u00fdch l\u00e1tek, mnohdy i z minim\u00e1ln\u00edho mno\u017estv\u00ed vzorku.<\/p>\n<p>Jednou z\u00a0nejv\u00fdznamn\u011bj\u0161\u00edch drog je <a href=\"https:\/\/cs.wikipedia.org\/wiki\/Kokain\"><strong>kokain<\/strong><\/a>. Jedn\u00e1 se o alkaloid z\u00edsk\u00e1van\u00fd z\u00a0list\u016f koky, kter\u00fd se typicky prod\u00e1v\u00e1 jako b\u00edl\u00fd krystalick\u00fd pr\u00e1\u0161ek. M\u016f\u017ee b\u00fdt bu\u010f ve form\u011b soli rozpustn\u00e9 ve vod\u011b (k inhalaci \u010di nitro\u017eiln\u00ed aplikaci) nebo jako voln\u00e1 b\u00e1ze (crack) ke kou\u0159en\u00ed. Pro zv\u00fd\u0161en\u00ed objemu produktu se kokain \u010dasto m\u00edch\u00e1 s\u00a0dal\u0161\u00edmi l\u00e1tkami, kter\u00e9 jsou levn\u00e9 nebo u\u017eivatel\u016fm poskytuj\u00ed dal\u0161\u00ed fyziologick\u00e9 \u00fa\u010dinky. Mezi nej\u010dast\u011bji p\u0159id\u00e1van\u00e9 l\u00e1tky pat\u0159\u00ed nap\u0159. kofein, hydroxyzin, lidocain, levamisol, imidazothiazol, \u0161krob, fenacetin a cukry jako lakt\u00f3za, manitol \u010di gluk\u00f3za.<\/p>\n<p>Z\u00a0t\u011bchto jsme se v\u00a0tomto \u010dl\u00e1nku zam\u011b\u0159ili na levamisol a imidazothiazol, co\u017e jsou veterin\u00e1rn\u00ed antiparazitika, jejich\u017e popularita jako\u017eto \u0159edic\u00ed l\u00e1tky v\u00a0posledn\u00edm desetilet\u00ed v\u00fdrazn\u011b stoup\u00e1. V\u00a0sou\u010dasn\u00e9 dob\u011b se pro anal\u00fdzu podez\u0159el\u00fdch l\u00e1tek nejprve pou\u017e\u00edvaj\u00ed metody molekulov\u00e9 spektroskopie, aby pot\u00e9 vzorky byly podrobn\u011b analyzov\u00e1ny pomoc\u00ed GC-MS a GC-FID.<\/p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_11100\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-11100\" style=\"width: 460px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-11100\" src=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2022\/12\/37428c5b-300x200.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"460\" height=\"306\" srcset=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2022\/12\/37428c5b-300x200.png 300w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2022\/12\/37428c5b-768x511.png 768w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2022\/12\/37428c5b.png 853w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 460px) 100vw, 460px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-11100\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Ramanovo spektrum obou forem kokainu a levamisolu, \u010dast\u00e9 \u0159edic\u00ed l\u00e1tky<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p>Pro rychlou anal\u00fdzu vyvinula forenzn\u00ed laborato\u0159 v\u00a0Lille kvantitativn\u00ed aplikaci <a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/modelova-rada\/raman\/\"><strong>Ramanovy spektroskopie<\/strong><\/a> (FT-IR a FT-Raman\u016fv spektrometr <a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/produkt\/nicolet-is50\/\"><strong>Nicolet iS50<\/strong><\/a>), kterou lze kombinovat s\u00a0chemometrick\u00fdmi metodami, a ur\u010dit tak koncentraci kokainu a antiparazitika lze b\u011bhem n\u011bkolika m\u00e1lo des\u00edtek sekund. D\u00edky tomu je mo\u017en\u00e9 z\u00edskat p\u0159esn\u00e9 v\u00fdsledky mnohem rychleji. S\u00a0touto technikou lze nav\u00edc analyzovat ve\u0161ker\u00e9 p\u0159\u00eddavn\u00e9 l\u00e1tky, na kter\u00e9 je mo\u017en\u00e9 narazit, tvo\u0159it vlastn\u00ed metody a proniknout tak hluboko do tajemstv\u00ed drogov\u00fdch laborato\u0159\u00ed.<\/p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_11102\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-11102\" style=\"width: 470px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-11102\" src=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2022\/12\/374ef5f7-300x141.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"470\" height=\"222\" srcset=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2022\/12\/374ef5f7-300x141.png 300w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2022\/12\/374ef5f7-768x362.png 768w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2022\/12\/374ef5f7.png 844w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 470px) 100vw, 470px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-11102\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Tvorba kalibra\u010dn\u00ed metody pro rychlou a p\u0159esnou anal\u00fdzu obsahu \u0159edic\u00ed l\u00e1tky v kokainu<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p>Nav\u00edc p\u0159\u00edprava vzork\u016f pro m\u011b\u0159en\u00ed pomoc\u00ed Ramanovy spektroskopie nen\u00ed pot\u0159eba, p\u0159\u00edpadn\u011b je minim\u00e1ln\u00ed. Je to tedy levn\u00e1, rychl\u00e1, spolehliv\u00e1 a p\u0159esn\u00e1 metoda, kter\u00e1 nevy\u017eaduje \u017e\u00e1dn\u00e9 dal\u0161\u00ed chemik\u00e1lie \u010di vysoce odborn\u00e9 pracovn\u00edky, a tak by <a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/produkt\/nicolet-is50\/\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>spektrometr Nicolet iS50<\/strong><\/span><\/a> nem\u011bl chyb\u011bt v \u017e\u00e1dn\u00e9 modern\u00ed laborato\u0159i. V\u00edce informac\u00ed <a href=\"https:\/\/www.azom.com\/article.aspx?ArticleID=22094&amp;CID=CMP-05228-W4T6&amp;utm_source=Comms-PR&amp;utm_medium=Twitter&amp;utm_campaign=CMP-05228-W4T6\"><strong>najdete zde<\/strong><\/a>.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Ve v\u0161ech d\u016fle\u017eit\u00fdch p\u0159\u00edstavech severn\u00ed Evropy v\u00fdrazn\u011b nar\u016fst\u00e1 mno\u017estv\u00ed zadr\u017een\u00fdch neleg\u00e1ln\u00edch drog. Rotterdam, Anvers, Dunkerque a Le Havre jsou pova\u017eov\u00e1ny za hlavn\u00ed br\u00e1ny pa\u0161er\u00e1k\u016f do Evropy. A zat\u00edmco drogov\u00ed magn\u00e1ti se raduj\u00ed z\u00a0p\u0159edstavy b\u00edl\u00fdch V\u00e1noc, bezpe\u010dnostn\u00ed slo\u017eky a jejich laborato\u0159e jsou postaveny p\u0159ed \u00fakol rychl\u00e9 a spolehliv\u00e9 identifikace podez\u0159el\u00fdch l\u00e1tek, mnohdy i z minim\u00e1ln\u00edho mno\u017estv\u00ed [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":2,"featured_media":11098,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[109,9],"tags":[],"class_list":["post-11097","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-109","category-novinky"],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v26.8 - https:\/\/yoast.com\/product\/yoast-seo-wordpress\/ -->\n<title>Nen\u00ed sn\u00edh jako sn\u00edh: Kvantitativn\u00ed anal\u00fdza kokainu pomoc\u00ed FT-Ramanovy spektroskopie - Nicolet CZ<\/title>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" \/>\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/neni-snih-jako-snih-kvantitativni-analyza-kokainu-pomoci-ft-ramanovy-spektroskopie\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"cs_CZ\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Nen\u00ed sn\u00edh jako sn\u00edh: Kvantitativn\u00ed anal\u00fdza kokainu pomoc\u00ed FT-Ramanovy spektroskopie - Nicolet CZ\" \/>